WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.206
Pinwheel the necromancer who stole the power of a Gravelord.

00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:05.890
A mother, a child and a father

00:00:05.890 --> 00:00:07.094
all fused into one form.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:10.569
His tale is one of guilt, regret

00:00:10.649 --> 00:00:13.694
and a desperate desire to fix his mistakes.

00:00:14.099 --> 00:00:18.101
Death masks are mementos of the
dead representing the wearer before

00:00:18.119 --> 00:00:19.830
they passed away.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:23.000
Mask of the Father: this mask
belonging to the valiant father

00:00:23.055 --> 00:00:25.600
represents great burden and equipment load.

00:00:26.039 --> 00:00:27.598
The father made a mistake

00:00:27.949 --> 00:00:29.954
and he carries that burden with him.

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:32.800
It's literally a constant weight upon
him.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.034
Mask of the Child:

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:39.047
this mask belonging to the naive child
represents the limitless energy and

00:00:39.047 --> 00:00:41.065
stamina of youth.

00:00:41.065 --> 00:00:42.500
Mask of the Mother:

00:00:42.700 --> 00:00:44.786
this mask belonging to the kindly
mother

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:48.059
represents the life giver and her
vitality.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:50.860
A long time ago, something happened to this family

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:53.020
and they were brought together through necromancy.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.600
The father bears the weight of his wife and his child on his back.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.400
A family woven together to become
Pinwheel.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:03.680
It seems as if in another time long past the human mother and child died

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.400
tragically and the father was overcome by grief.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.600
Without family, it is said that man is
alone in the world.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:13.600
But he was valiant and in his
desperation to be reunited with his family

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.800
he took great risk to steal power from a Lord of Death: Nito.

00:01:21.020 --> 00:01:23.200
With this power he attempted necromancy

00:01:23.200 --> 00:01:25.700
reviving the corpses of his wife and
child...

00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:27.200
But something went wrong.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:30.600
In his desperation to be reunited with
his family,

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:34.600
his necromancy backfired and the family
became... Whole.

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.700
A mother, child and father

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:41.100
reunited in a physical grotesque form: Pinwheel

00:01:42.160 --> 00:01:47.760
In his current form, Pinwheel resides in the crypt filled with his tireless efforts at necromancy and revival.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:54.220
The creature is still sane and continues to devote itself to experimentation and research into necromancy.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.500
But why?

00:01:55.820 --> 00:01:57.940
While the corpses of the mother and child were restored,

00:01:58.160 --> 00:01:59.560
but at what cost?

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.380
They live on as an abomination.

00:02:01.600 --> 00:02:06.080
The only thing  Pinwheel has managed to do so far is split itself into various forms,

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:09.200
which are dumped and discarded at the entrance to Nito's tomb.

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:13.940
Assumedly, Pinwheel is trying to split
itself into separate beings so that

00:02:13.940 --> 00:02:15.954
the Father, the Mother and the Child

00:02:15.960 --> 00:02:18.985
can be properly restored as was
originally intended.

00:02:19.280 --> 00:02:20.343
But nothing works...

00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:23.280
For some reason, his crypt is open when you meet him.

00:02:23.640 --> 00:02:27.340
Imagine how shocked he must be to see an intruder after all these years.

00:02:27.720 --> 00:02:30.774
Someone who would interfere with his
attempt to make things right.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.460
Who knows how close he was to success.

00:02:33.780 --> 00:02:36.300
How close he was to fixing his mistake...

